{
  "bvid": "BV1pVnVzCE13",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "74765bee1cbcbf9c5dd5989aa5c3f73d3cff8bb480e157eb19af86aee5e3d224",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 60,
      "end_ms": 1780,
      "text": "就是随便胡扯一下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 1780,
      "end_ms": 3060,
      "text": "有人有有的是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 3060,
      "end_ms": 6340,
      "text": "一个北京的小小朋友说什么什么隐忍"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 6340,
      "end_ms": 7710,
      "text": "什么东西啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 7990,
      "end_ms": 9310,
      "text": "哪个省份的我记不得了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 9310,
      "end_ms": 11470,
      "text": "就好像他们帮我查了一下哪个省份的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 11470,
      "end_ms": 12290,
      "text": "记不太得了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 12290,
      "end_ms": 14870,
      "text": "这个小孩那就是隐忍"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 14870,
      "end_ms": 15990,
      "text": "就做马克思主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 15990,
      "end_ms": 17195,
      "text": "要隐忍"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 19300,
      "end_ms": 21660,
      "text": "首先单做马克思主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 21660,
      "end_ms": 23060,
      "text": "完完全不要隐忍"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 23060,
      "end_ms": 26120,
      "text": "因为就是说马克思和列宁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 26120,
      "end_ms": 28940,
      "text": "二胜并举才是职业玩家标配啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 28940,
      "end_ms": 30380,
      "text": "无论是什么托派啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 30380,
      "end_ms": 31300,
      "text": "还是是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 31300,
      "end_ms": 32560,
      "text": "就是列列派"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 32560,
      "end_ms": 34260,
      "text": "就是还是什么斯大林主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 34260,
      "end_ms": 37230,
      "text": "还是后面我们的这个啊是毛主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 37230,
      "end_ms": 38950,
      "text": "就二胜并举才是标配"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 38950,
      "end_ms": 41480,
      "text": "如果他只是说自己是马克思主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 41880,
      "end_ms": 43960,
      "text": "那么在现在的国际共运潮流里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 43960,
      "end_ms": 45760,
      "text": "单说自己是马克思主义者的那些人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 45760,
      "end_ms": 52480,
      "text": "跟是跟把马克思主义从这个这个这个是什么啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 53960,
      "end_ms": 56440,
      "text": "社民国际开调的那个社民社民义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 58060,
      "end_ms": 59460,
      "text": "单讲马克思主义的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 62239,
      "end_ms": 63350,
      "text": "没什么区别"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 63350,
      "end_ms": 65830,
      "text": "所以这种什么隐忍隐忍个毛啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 68550,
      "end_ms": 70690,
      "text": "除非你是搞的是白色那一套"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 70690,
      "end_ms": 74610,
      "text": "搞的是要这个是什么资产阶级制宪的那一套"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 74610,
      "end_ms": 76010,
      "text": "那你当然要隐忍啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 76010,
      "end_ms": 77110,
      "text": "你是白色分子吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 77110,
      "end_ms": 77890,
      "text": "地下分子啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 77890,
      "end_ms": 79370,
      "text": "实际就自由派了对吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 79370,
      "end_ms": 80789,
      "text": "说穿了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 81149,
      "end_ms": 83789,
      "text": "只不过说这个是一个马克思主义的一个国家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 84789,
      "end_ms": 86029,
      "text": "所以你在这里要假模假样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 86029,
      "end_ms": 88190,
      "text": "你还在念马克思主义的经啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 88190,
      "end_ms": 89550,
      "text": "还有假不假列"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 89550,
      "end_ms": 90550,
      "text": "马克思列宁主义记"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 90550,
      "end_ms": 91470,
      "text": "那么另外一方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 91470,
      "end_ms": 92470,
      "text": "如果你是个列宁主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 92470,
      "end_ms": 93410,
      "text": "马列主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 93410,
      "end_ms": 94230,
      "text": "那好了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 94230,
      "end_ms": 96770,
      "text": "列宁主义有一个基本要求"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 96770,
      "end_ms": 99180,
      "text": "就是不能搞宗派啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 99180,
      "end_ms": 104270,
      "text": "就是一定要像像这个呃主力军靠拢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 104270,
      "end_ms": 105870,
      "text": "要服从主力军调遣"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 105870,
      "end_ms": 106590,
      "text": "这是一方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 106590,
      "end_ms": 107290,
      "text": "另外一方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 107290,
      "end_ms": 110360,
      "text": "列宁主义还要什么职业的革命斗争"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 110360,
      "end_ms": 111780,
      "text": "一定要职业化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 111780,
      "end_ms": 113400,
      "text": "那你隐忍怎么职业化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 113400,
      "end_ms": 114680,
      "text": "你这赢了都忍了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 114680,
      "end_ms": 117230,
      "text": "你是不是拿拿头这么职业化呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 117230,
      "end_ms": 117950,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 117950,
      "end_ms": 121400,
      "text": "你靠什么来获得职业活动的经历经验呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 121400,
      "end_ms": 124360,
      "text": "你怎么怎么怎么验证你的活动的有效性啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 124360,
      "end_ms": 126280,
      "text": "你要非常职业才行啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 126280,
      "end_ms": 127300,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 127300,
      "end_ms": 128660,
      "text": "安全方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 128660,
      "end_ms": 129880,
      "text": "网络安全方面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 129880,
      "end_ms": 132340,
      "text": "你这要找专职的非常职业的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 132340,
      "end_ms": 134000,
      "text": "而且你要和他们去合作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 134000,
      "end_ms": 136860,
      "text": "所以要和他们竞争啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 136860,
      "end_ms": 137540,
      "text": "线下活动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 137540,
      "end_ms": 138980,
      "text": "地下活动甚至地下活动的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 138980,
      "end_ms": 139540,
      "text": "你要去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 139540,
      "end_ms": 141160,
      "text": "那你就说国内找不到"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 141160,
      "end_ms": 142380,
      "text": "那去国际上找"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 143580,
      "end_ms": 145470,
      "text": "你怎么可能隐忍呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 145670,
      "end_ms": 146650,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 146650,
      "end_ms": 148630,
      "text": "而且你既然你要活动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 148630,
      "end_ms": 150230,
      "text": "你要去参与职业活动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 150230,
      "end_ms": 151150,
      "text": "锻炼你的能力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 151150,
      "end_ms": 153990,
      "text": "锻炼你的这个团队架构"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 154350,
      "end_ms": 155410,
      "text": "长足发展"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 155410,
      "end_ms": 156210,
      "text": "你得有钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 156210,
      "end_ms": 156630,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 157990,
      "end_ms": 161430,
      "text": "而且说地下秘密经配体系啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 161430,
      "end_ms": 162470,
      "text": "我不相信"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 162470,
      "end_ms": 166070,
      "text": "哈哈哈啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 166070,
      "end_ms": 167790,
      "text": "你这个激进度怎么透出来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 167790,
      "end_ms": 172649,
      "text": "那你这个如果说是呃马克思列宁主义者来说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 172649,
      "end_ms": 174689,
      "text": "靠地下激进经费体系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 174689,
      "end_ms": 177609,
      "text": "那这个经费体系要从工人群众当中来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 177609,
      "end_ms": 180144,
      "text": "要从你的阶级基础当中来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 180560,
      "end_ms": 187260,
      "text": "那你所作所为就一定不可能是什么隐忍性质的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 187260,
      "end_ms": 192270,
      "text": "而是要用切实的行动去保障劳动者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 192270,
      "end_ms": 197190,
      "text": "或者说更为广大劳动者难以去去调动起来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 197190,
      "end_ms": 197970,
      "text": "那你要怎么样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 197970,
      "end_ms": 204260,
      "text": "青年那一部分就是思想比较开放进步的青年"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 204260,
      "end_ms": 206610,
      "text": "但是他们是劳动者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 206810,
      "end_ms": 208190,
      "text": "你要调动起他们"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 208190,
      "end_ms": 210810,
      "text": "你才有知识现实的支撑"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 212060,
      "end_ms": 213800,
      "text": "所以你更不能隐忍啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 213800,
      "end_ms": 216940,
      "text": "所以你要要要去宣扬你的生活方式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 216940,
      "end_ms": 219860,
      "text": "你要去夸耀你的功绩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 220510,
      "end_ms": 221110,
      "text": "按理说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 221110,
      "end_ms": 224430,
      "text": "你是靠隐忍才得到这个地下经费链的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 224430,
      "end_ms": 225070,
      "text": "一个支持的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 225070,
      "end_ms": 226560,
      "text": "那说明你的这地下经费链"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 226560,
      "end_ms": 228040,
      "text": "不是来自己的阶级基础了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 228040,
      "end_ms": 229960,
      "text": "不是来自于群众基础了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 229960,
      "end_ms": 233380,
      "text": "那是来自于什么其他阶级了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 233380,
      "end_ms": 235160,
      "text": "这不来自于无产阶级啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 235160,
      "end_ms": 236500,
      "text": "他说那那经费链"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 236500,
      "end_ms": 238740,
      "text": "你的经费体系来自于他妈的资产阶级"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 238740,
      "end_ms": 239460,
      "text": "小资产阶级"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 239460,
      "end_ms": 240660,
      "text": "那你说你是马列主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 240660,
      "end_ms": 244419,
      "text": "我不信你的经费纯粹来自资产阶级"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 244419,
      "end_ms": 247559,
      "text": "小小小资产阶级纯粹只来自于他们的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 247559,
      "end_ms": 251410,
      "text": "不可能你不可能具有阶级代表性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 252520,
      "end_ms": 254200,
      "text": "说马克思当年是吃恩格斯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 254200,
      "end_ms": 255660,
      "text": "马克思只吃恩格斯吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 255660,
      "end_ms": 257339,
      "text": "只吃恩格斯家里面的钱吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 257339,
      "end_ms": 258100,
      "text": "不可能的呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 258100,
      "end_ms": 259500,
      "text": "他更多的在地活动经费"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 259500,
      "end_ms": 261430,
      "text": "是来自于他的阶级基础哎"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 261430,
      "end_ms": 263370,
      "text": "来自于他群众基础诶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 263370,
      "end_ms": 267110,
      "text": "所以你这光是这个隐忍说就直接"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 267110,
      "end_ms": 268630,
      "text": "那你经费从哪来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 268630,
      "end_ms": 269590,
      "text": "秘密经费吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 269590,
      "end_ms": 270430,
      "text": "秘密经费哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 270430,
      "end_ms": 272450,
      "text": "然后秘密经费你就靠的是秘密"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 272450,
      "end_ms": 276010,
      "text": "什么经费是来自于你的阶级基础的秘密经费吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 276010,
      "end_ms": 276950,
      "text": "如果不是的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 276950,
      "end_ms": 279690,
      "text": "就是来自于你的敌对阶级的秘密经费"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 279690,
      "end_ms": 282170,
      "text": "那你肯定不是马列主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 282530,
      "end_ms": 284130,
      "text": "很简单呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 285480,
      "end_ms": 288840,
      "text": "还隐忍前头男人嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 290820,
      "end_ms": 292860,
      "text": "好那我们先不说经费问题了"
    },
